For future engineering team members, here is the official workflow for deploying and reading the new SSO blueprint:

Deploy the Identity: During a live deployment window, navigate to the infrastructure folder and execute:
#
bash
terraform apply
#
Retrieve the Client ID: The script will automatically print out your custom sso_client_id directly inside your terminal panel.

Retrieve the Client Password: To grab your hidden secure string to pass into Render, execute this manual command:

bash

terraform output sso_client_secret